[node name="ChangesRTLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MainCenter/MainPanel/MainContainer/InfoContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]New[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] Wizard has some extra options for eyes and horns.
 Wizard characters have extra options for spikes and ridges
 Generated tag list has a right-click menu to copy your tags
 You can now export/import characters from the Wizard Characters Tool
 Added new shortcuts:
[ul] Menu dropdown: Alt+M
 Help Menu: Alt+H
 (Wiki) Focus tag text field: Ctrl+F
 (Tags tab) Focus tag text field: Ctrl+F
 (Tags tab) Open adv. search: Ctrl+Shift+F
 (Tags tab) Copy your generated list: Alt+C[/ul][/ul]
[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]Fixes[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] Fixed the wizard including some invalid color-count tags.
 Fixed the prefixes not working.
 Blacklist tags & blacklist groups can now be multi-selected. Including doing CTRL+A
 Wiki thumbnails will now scroll based on which image is focused.
 Fixed wrong error codes on some logs.
 Fixed wizard characters' properties sometimes not applying on the Wizard[/ul]
[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]Changes[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] Changed wizard \"pussy\" tags to \"vulva\" as per e621 B.U.R. #11431
 Range of horns has been compacted to a checkbox list
 Horns has now a horn count
 Made keyboard navigation more usable in Tagger, Wiki, Tag & tools tabs.
 Easier usability on Tags tab & Wiki tab. If you start writing it'll automatically focus the text field and allow you to write.
 Focused images in wiki will have a light blue contour.
 Wiki scrolls can now be focused and moved using arrow keys (excluding the images scroll)
 Slightly improved Wiki page fetcher.
 Wizard can now be exited with ESC key.
 Changed the multi nipple toggle on the Wizard for a range.[/ul]"
